{"name":"🎉 欢迎使用 Mneme 记忆管理","dsl":{"schema":"2.0","config":{"update_multi":true},"body":{"direction":"vertical","elements":[{"tag":"markdown","content":"**首次使用需要配置多维表格的存储位置。**\n\n📁 多维表格将创建在你指定的文件夹中\n\n🔑 需要提供文件夹 token（从飞书云空间 URL 中获取）\n\n---\n\n**获取文件夹 token 的方法：**\n\n1. 打开飞书云空间\n2. 进入目标文件夹\n3. 从 URL 中复制 token\n\n**云空间 URL 示例：**\n```\nhttps://feishu.cn/drive/folder/folcnxxxxxx/...\n```\nfolder_token = `folcnxxxxxx`\n\n---\n\n**配置方式（任选其一）：**\n\n**方式一：填写下方表单**\n输入 folder_token 并点击确定\n","text_align":"left"},{"tag":"hr"},{"tag":"form","elements":[{"tag":"input","placeholder":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"请输入文件夹 token（例如：folcnxxxxxx）"},"default_value":"","width":"fill","required":true,"name":"folder_token"},{"tag":"button","text":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"确定"},"type":"primary_filled","width":"fill","behaviors":[{"type":"callback","value":{"action":"confirm_token"}}],"form_action_type":"submit","name":"confirm_button"}],"direction":"vertical","horizontal_align":"left","vertical_align":"top","padding":"12px 12px 12px 12px","name":"config_form"},{"tag":"hr"},{"tag":"markdown","content":"**方式二：使用文本指令**\n\n**使用机器人空间：**\n```\n@Mneme 使用机器人空间\n```\n\n**使用自定义文件夹：**\n```\n@Mneme folder:folcnxxxxxx\n```\n\n---\n\n配置完成后，重新发送记忆即可自动创建多维表格。","text_align":"left"}]},"header":{"title":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"🎉 欢迎使用 Mneme 记忆管理"},"subtitle":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"配置多维表格存储位置"},"template":"blue","padding":"12px 8px 12px 8px"}},"variables":[]}
